pair. Would definitely buy it again and recommend to everyone.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-8","r":5.0,"t":"Stop scrolling and get this version!","x":"I looked through so many options of this tool and finally decided on this one. Very sharp and very precise! Very high quality too. Would recommended!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-9","r":5.0,"t":"Super nice nail kit","x":"For half or quarter of the money, you can have salon quality products and not worry about getting someone else\u2019s germs on you.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-10","r":5.0,"t":"Super nice nail kit","x":"For half or quarter of the money, you can have salon quality products and not worry about getting someone else\u2019s germs on you.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-11","r":2.0,"t":"Not so strudy","x":"The cuticle nipper gets stuck when using them. I literally have to keep prying them apart. I ended up hurting my self.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great value and quality.","x":"Great for the money.  Presently surprised.  Nippers were nice and sharp.  I would recommend this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-13","r":1.0,"t":"Not a good buy, fell apart while using","x":"The nipper fell apart while I was using it the first time, not made very well. Would not buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-14","r":1.0,"t":"Not pleased","x":"The cuticle nipper kept getting stuck. It does not open and close as it should","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-15","r":5.0,"t":"Good deal","x":"These are great quality and I would highly recommend them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-16","r":1.0,"t":"No lo volver\u00e9 a comprar","x":"No me gust\u00f3 dif\u00edcil de manipular el cortacuticulas","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-17","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing","x":"One word....Amazing! Nothing else needs to be said.  Cuticle cutter has a long head which is very hard to find and those the only ones I like to use.  Be careful it is very sharp and if you don't know what you doing you will cut yourself.  Overall great product not cheap at all well made and sturdy.  I highly recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-18","r":5.0,"t":"Hurt no more","x":"My nails looks so bad, weak and brittle that I need to work on them to get them healthy. I bought these items to help with my self-manicure and they do help.  I do see a change and they don\u2019t hurt as much now since I\u2019m not biting or pulling on them. I use my tools now and my cream that I bought. Good stuff.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-19","r":5.0,"t":"Salon-grade quality nail tools","x":"I ordered this product to be able to remove my gel nails at home. I was surprised at how well-made and sturdy each of the tools are. I only planned on using the cuticle peeler but ended up using all three tools that came with the order. I highly recommend this one!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-20","r":5.0,"t":"Salon-grade quality nail tools","x":"I ordered this product to be able to remove my gel nails at home. I was surprised at how well-made and sturdy each of the tools are. I only planned on using the cuticle peeler but ended up using all three tools that came with the order. I highly recommend this one!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great little nippers","x":"These are super sharp nippers! They get a very close trim. Be careful not to press too hard, it's really sharp and easy to cut too deeply. Just use a light hand. The blades allow you to trim closely, so that's a nice feature. Definitely a good buy!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-22","r":4.0,"t":"Great for home manicure","x":"The nail salons are closed & I needed to get the dip polish off my nails. It\u2019s easy to use the clipper to get that skin that grows between your nails & skin clipped even with the opposite hand. The cuticle pusher worked really well also.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great bang for your buck","x":"My old cuticle clippers were so dull and awful. These are a great replacement pair! Really easy to use, sturdy cover for storage, and nice and sharp so you aren't hacking away at yourself. Highly recommend!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0793RGV6C-24","r":4.0,"t":"Nice for the price","x":"These cuticle cutters should just be used for that. I was nipping at some acrylic and it bent the tip. So they aren\u2019t the best(durable) but they are sharp and if just used for cuticles will last!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the cuticle nippers very sharp, precise, and effective for detailed cuticle work.","cites":[3,5,8,9,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers consider the set a great value for the price, offering quality comparable to salon products.","cites":[3,4,10,11,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the cuticle nippers get stuck, requiring prying apart, and that this led to injury.","cites":[1,12,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers describe poor build quality, with the nipper falling apart or rusting after use.","cites":[7,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the cutters caused cuts, though one attributes this to user error rather than the product.","cites":[1,2,3]}]},"qa":[]}